      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.89,
      "end_seconds": 4.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.28,
      "end_seconds": 10.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Alright, of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.51,
      "end_seconds": 18.9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "doctor, it's sudden breathlessness five days after surgery it's getting on my nerves now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.24,
      "end_seconds": 24.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "When was the the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.48,
      "end_seconds": 28.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "I've had it for one week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.9,
      "end_seconds": 31.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "hm, okay any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.72,
      "end_seconds": 43.46,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "A racing heart goes along with it, most of the time. The racing heart? That's been since yesterday"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.36,
      "end_seconds": 47.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "have you had a swollen calf?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.35,
      "end_seconds": 50.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Yes, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.86,
      "end_seconds": 69.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Have you had any coughing up blood, wound problem or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.93,
      "end_seconds": 71.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "none of those, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.54,
      "end_seconds": 74.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.51,
      "end_seconds": 78.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.69,
      "end_seconds": 82.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.53,
      "end_seconds": 85.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.86,
      "end_seconds": 89.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.51,
      "end_seconds": 93.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "no, I'm not on anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.79,
      "end_seconds": 98.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "okay, has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.79,
      "end_seconds": 102.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.69,
      "end_seconds": 118.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.21,
      "end_seconds": 121.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.26,
      "end_seconds": 125.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "a few questions about your lifestyle now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.36,
      "end_seconds": 136.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.54,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I look after my grandchildren most days. Not much, I mostly stay in these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.54,
      "end_seconds": 149.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "let me take your readings now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.74,
      "end_seconds": 158.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.0,
      "end_seconds": 187.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "okay: pressure 120 over 82, pulse is 84 beats a minute, temperature 36.9, respiratory rate 22, saturation 91 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.98,
      "end_seconds": 192.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.98,
      "end_seconds": 195.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.79,
      "end_seconds": 198.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.47,
      "end_seconds": 215.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Your left calf is swollen and tender and your oxygen is low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.67,
      "end_seconds": 233.3,
      "duration_seconds": 12.63,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Let me tell you where I've got to. This looks most like a possible blood clot in the lung after surgery. We shouldn't forget a chest infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.26,
      "end_seconds": 236.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.03,
      "end_seconds": 262.77,
      "duration_seconds": 23.74,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a possible blood clot in the lung after surgery do well once it's treated properly let me just check I've got this right you've had sudden breathlessness five days after surgery for one week, and no coughing up blood or fever"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.98,
      "end_seconds": 264.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.55,
      "end_seconds": 284.6,
      "duration_seconds": 19.05,
      "text": "Let's book a D-dimer to look into possible clot. Let's book a CT pulmonary angiogram to look into possible pulmonary embolus. You'll be taking enoxaparin, 1.5 mg per kg, once now, single dose. It's for possible clot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.62,
      "end_seconds": 289.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "is that safe with my other medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.28,
      "end_seconds": 301.31,
      "duration_seconds": 11.03,
      "text": "Please go to hospital now, I will call ahead. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.2,
      "end_seconds": 306.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "hmm, I know what to watch for"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.47,
      "end_seconds": 318.14,
      "duration_seconds": 7.67,
      "text": "See me again straight away. Is there anything you'd like me to to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.99,
      "end_seconds": 322.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}